[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7081.189, "timestamp": "01:58:01", "text": "抵抗して食べる。 ああ、それが彼が"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7083.43, "timestamp": "01:58:03", "text": "着ていたものだったんですね。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7105.03, "timestamp": "01:58:25", "text": "では、持って"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7107.83, "timestamp": "01:58:27", "text": "いるアイテムのレア度を上げるにはどうすればいいですか？   わからない"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7109.51, "timestamp": "01:58:29", "text": "。 たまたま手に入れただけなんです"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7111.109, "timestamp": "01:58:31", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7113.669, "timestamp": "01:58:33", "text": "はぁ。   仮に"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7114.95, "timestamp": "01:58:34", "text": "私が何かを必要としているとしましょう。 私が買います"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7117.91, "timestamp": "01:58:37", "text": "。 そして、何が必要だったのかを見てください"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7120.229, "timestamp": "01:58:40", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7122.87, "timestamp": "01:58:42", "text": "うん、最高レベルに到達したよ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7125.91, "timestamp": "01:58:45", "text": "え、それって最高級の金属なの？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7129.43, "timestamp": "01:58:49", "text": "うん、それは僕が使ってた鎧よりずっとかっこいいね"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7130.31, "timestamp": "01:58:50", "text": "。"}]